From: liyuan <liyuan390@huawei.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 18:21:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] test(control): cover prepare-only arming, adoption, stops
 and reporting

Exercise the real service arming half, the real supervisor and the real
registry with only the research step and the report generator substituted.
Covers: no spawn and no pid on prepare; adoption of an unset identity; refusal
of a foreign identity and a wrong token; the positive not-started record for a
pending stop; a single research cancellation with no surviving control task; a
reporting stop that keeps research completed and states the report incomplete;
the natural path leaving no waiter; and the unchanged legacy 'stopping' path.
---
